# Google Books (books) — REST, no OAuth.
#
# An API key is OPTIONAL: unauthenticated requests work but share a low
# public quota. If you create a key, put it in http-client.private.env.json
# as `googleBooksKey` and add `&key={{googleBooksKey}}` to the requests.

### Search volumes by free text
GET https://www.googleapis.com/books/v1/volumes?q=hollow+knight&maxResults=5&key={{googleBooksKey}}

### Search by title + author (field-scoped query)
GET https://www.googleapis.com/books/v1/volumes?q=intitle:dune+inauthor:herbert&maxResults=5&key={{googleBooksKey}}

### Look up a single volume by ISBN
GET https://www.googleapis.com/books/v1/volumes?q=isbn:9780441172719&key={{googleBooksKey}}

### Get a single volume by its Google volume id
GET https://www.googleapis.com/books/v1/volumes/zyTCAlFPjgYC?key={{googleBooksKey}}
